What is the output of the following program?
```java
class BaseEntity {
    BaseEntity() {
        show();
    }
    void show() {
        System.out.print("Base ");
    }
}
class DerivedEntity extends BaseEntity {
    int count = 99;
    void show() {
        System.out.print("Count:" + count + " ");
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        new DerivedEntity();
    }
}
```

